@startuml US108-SD
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Backoffice Operator / ATCC" as Actor
participant "«filter»\nJwtAuthenticationFilter" as Filter
participant "AirportController" as Controller
participant "SearchAirportsUseCaseImpl" as UseCase
participant "AirportRepository" as Repo

Actor -> Filter : GET /airports?city=Lisbon&country=Portugal\nAccept: application/hal+json
activate Filter

note right of Filter
  See security/SD-AuthFilter.puml
  Required role(s) for this US: BACKOFFICE_OPERATOR, ATCC
end note

Filter -> Controller : forward authenticated request
deactivate Filter
activate Controller

Controller -> UseCase : searchAirports(name, city, country)
activate UseCase

UseCase -> Repo : searchByCriteria(name, city, country)
activate Repo

note right of Repo
  JPQL LIKE query, case-insensitive substring match.
  NULL params = pass-all (all airports returned if no criteria).
  Filter logic in repository to avoid loading full aggregates.
end note

Repo --> UseCase : List<Airport>
deactivate Repo

UseCase --> Controller : List<Airport>
deactivate UseCase

note right of Controller
  Maps each Airport → AirportSummaryResponseDTO
  (iataCode, name, city, country, status).
  Wraps in CollectionModel.of(items, self-link).
  Each item gets a self link → GET /airports/{iataCode}.
  Empty list → 200 OK (never 404 on a search).
  See CD for DTO structure.
end note

Controller --> Actor : 200 OK\n{ "_embedded": { "airports": [...] },\n  "_links": { "self": "..." } }

deactivate Controller
@enduml
